季最基础也最关键的一份文件就是 ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Form 8843"}],"。",["$","br",null,{}],"无论你 2025 年是否有收入，只要你依然被定义为 ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"F1 Non-resident"}],"（非居民），这份表就是你的“身份保命符”。"]}],["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/1040-nr-filling-guide","className":"mt-6 group block rounded-2xl border-2 border-dashed border-brand-pink/40 bg-brand-pink/5 p-5 transition-all hover:bg-brand-pink/10 hover:border-brand-pink/60 active:scale-[0.98]","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-2xl animate-bounce","children":"✨"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-brand-pinkdeep font-bold text-base sm:text-lg","children":"【2026最新】1040-NR 交互式填写指南与罚款计算器已上线，点击直达 →"}]]}]}],["$","$L3",null,{}],["$","div",null,{"className":"prose prose-pink max-w-none mt-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold mt-12 mb-6 text-brand-ink","children":"什么是 Form 8843？为什么 F1/OPT 必须重视 Form 8843？"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-brand-ink/75 leading-7","children":["Form 8843 全称是 ",["$","em",null,{"children":"Statement for Exempt Individuals and Individuals with a Medical Condition"}],"。 它的核心作用不是报钱，而是",["$","strong",null,{"children":"声明豁免身份"}],"。"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-brand-ink/75 leading-7 mt-4","children":["很多人会问：“我去年一整年都在找工作，没有任何收入（W2/1099），我也要报税吗？” 答案是肯定的。",["$","br",null,{}],"你要做的，就是通过这份表，向 IRS 说明：虽然我在美国待的天数可能符合“实质居住测试（SPT）”，但因为我是持 F1 项目的学生， 按照税法规定，我的天数不应计入判定，我依然可以维持 Non-resident 身份，享受学生专属的税务优惠。"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-[20px] bg-brand-pink/10 p-6 my-6","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-brand-pinkdeep mb-2","children":"五年规则（5-Year Rule）"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-brand-ink/80","children":["F1 学生在美的前 5 个“日历年”通常被视为 Exempt Individual。 比如你是 2021 年入境，那么 2021, 2022, 2023, 2024, 2025 这五年你都是 Non-resident。 即使你在 2025 年进入了 ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"STEM 延期"}],"，只要没超过 5 年，你依然需要填 8843。"]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl sm:tex